  {
   "bbox": [
    33.84,
    522.96,
    270.0,
    600.48
   ],
   "id": "e8",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.32,
      522.96,
      269.52,
      532.32
     ],
     "text": "Description\u2014see comparison tables and figs. 6 and 8."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.8,
      537.12,
      270.0,
      546.0
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Kirsten\u2019 is a hybrid Hydrangea with low, bushy growth and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.08,
      548.16,
      269.76,
      556.8
     ],
     "text": "light green, oval leaves with acuminate apices. Venation of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.32,
      558.96,
      270.0,
      567.6
     ],
     "text": "leaf is reticulate. The inflorescence is umbreila shaped and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      33.84,
      569.76,
      269.76,
      578.64
     ],
     "text": "flowers with a small calyx are inconspicuous. Sepals are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      33.84,
      580.8,
      270.0,
      589.44
     ],
     "text": "blue/red and average 4~5. Overlapping of sepals is sometimes"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      34.08,
      591.6,
      203.52,
      600.48
     ],
     "text": "present and there is no incision of the sepals."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Description\u2014see comparison tables and figs. 6 and 8.\n\u2018Kirsten\u2019 is a hybrid Hydrangea with low, bushy growth and\nlight green, oval leaves with acuminate apices. Venation of the\nleaf is reticulate. The inflorescence is umbreila shaped and\nflowers with a small calyx are inconspicuous. Sepals are\nblue/red and average 4~5. Overlapping of sepals is sometimes\npresent and there is no incision of the sepals.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
