      34.32,
      647.76,
      269.52,
      656.4
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Alpengluhen\u2019 as seed parent and \u2018No. 24\u2019 as pollen parent."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      33.84,
      658.56,
      269.52,
      667.44
     ],
     "text": "PVR was applied for in Germany in October 1985 and subse-"
